{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Heavy steel door slams",
  "description": "A heavy steel security door (cell block, bunker, plant room) thrown shut in a bare concrete corridor, heard from a few metres inside. First the slab swings in, pushing a low gust of air ahead of it, its dry hinge giving one short quiet creak. Then the door meets its steel frame: a massive, dead BOOM from the slab and the wall it hangs in, a hollow boxy bark from the door skin, and a hard, dense, crashing clang from edge on frame that the door's own mass soon chokes. Loose hardware chatters in the frame, and the spring bolt drops into its keep with a two-part ka-chunk. The corridor throws it all back: a slap off the far wall and a long, hard, bright concrete tail.",
  "tags": [
    "door",
    "metal",
    "steel",
    "slam",
    "heavy",
    "prison",
    "cell",
    "bunker",
    "hatch",
    "corridor",
    "close",
    "boom",
    "clang"
  ],
